ics, preserve seed behavior, and publish schema 4 with parity [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ledger keep helper and folded marks[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger-marks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract-rust[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger-marks: mirror the contract in freshness namespace v5, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sole increment helper, and render accessible folded pips with truthful [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision annotations.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Exact explicit-keep counting[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav-counting[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger-marks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav-counting: wire single, counted, and Task Link refreshes through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exact pre-write matching, atomic writes, accurate notices, and cache-lag[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]regressions.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared approved-decay action planner[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]decay-planner[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav-counting[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]decay-planner: compose existing priority and log planners into stable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]previewed decisions, including implicit P0 entry and a non-cancelling [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]default.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decision card and review-walk integration[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]decision-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after decay-planner[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision-card: add the consent interaction, guarded action application, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]batch skipping, leaf signal, and trial activation guard.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Integrated verification, documentation, and rollout[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after decision-card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: verify cross-repository reset and rendering behavior, publish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the accepted memory changes, deploy from the linked source, and document[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trial and calibration checks.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-3v","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-3v.1","bob-cli-3v.2","bob-cli-3v.3","bob-cli-3v.4","bob-cli-3v.5","bob-cli-3v.6"],"workflow_name":"bob-cli-3v.land"},"source_run_id":"run-4610f53481dd17d317f5d80dca855c4c","started_at":"2026-10-03T16:30:58.188260+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"33d096e617fb187939b4db7e68ac6e0ea20cdffd7385ce1c8fbf7ffcb0ed66b7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3v.land--gate/chat.md","size_bytes":552},"commits":{"digest":"d0a7348eee9dcfc39c9f8acb98f43f9bd2fa8671bd287ab37bbacdaa9a0ebc46","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3v.land--gate/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"b4c8251ec8bca1bcd678f2ec952f1f0b4813723b23414c55e34ce9950e2b5fb7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3v.land--gate/meta.json","size_bytes":746},"state":{"digest":"6d08a0bb7cc691ef9ca9d9c743d2e37df88f09cb92759c648974cb04d4ea5adb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3v.land--gate/state.json","size_bytes":210}},"finished_at":"2026-10-03T16:42:08.477658+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3v.land--gate","lo